/E (    Empathy involves both cognitive understanding of others' perspectives and affective resonance with their emotions. It includes affective empathy \(feeling what others feel\), cognitive empathy \(understanding others' mental states\), and compassionate empathy \(desire to help\). Empathy is mediated by mirror neurons and can be cultivated.)
